: 10"],["set_actor_item : 3 : 10","set_actor_item : 3 : 10"],["set_actor_item : 4 : 10","set_actor_item : 4 : 10"],["フックショットに変更しました","Changed to hook shot"],["EV019","EV019"],["キャラクターを「モブ対魔戦士」に切り替えます","Switch the character to \"Mob Anti-Demon Warrior\""],["set_actor_item : 1 : 11","set_actor_item : 1 : 11"],["set_actor_item : 2 : 11","set_actor_item : 2 : 11"],["set_actor_item : 3 : 11","set_actor_item : 3 : 11"],["set_actor_item : 4 : 11","set_actor_item : 4 : 11"],["弓矢に変更しました。","I changed to bow and arrow."],["EV026","EV026"],["EV027","EV027"],["EV029","EV029"],["宝を手に入れた！","I got the treasure!"],["EV030","EV030"],["EV031","EV031"],["EV032","EV032"],["<mizuki.idle.right>お疲れ様、烈火ちゃん。\n今日のパトロールはこれで終わりね |#M_0043|","<mizuki.idle.right>Thank you for your hard work, Rekka-chan.\nThat's all for today's patrol |#M_0043|"],["<mizuki.idle.right>残りは次の子に引き継ぎましょう|#M_0044|","<mizuki.idle.right>Turn the rest to the next child|#M_0044|"],["残りは次の子に引き継ぎましょう|#M_0044|","Pass the rest to the next child|#M_0044|"],["<rekka.sad.left>うーん・・・|#R_0027|","<rekka.sad.left>Hmm...|#R_0027|"],["<mizuki.sad.right>どうしたの、烈火ちゃん？|#M_0045|","<mizuki.sad.right>What's wrong, Rekka-chan? |#M_0045|"],["<rekka.sad.left>それが・・・次の対魔戦士の子が\n見当たらないんすよね|#R_0028|","<rekka.sad.left>That's... the next anti-magic warrior child\nI can't find it, right? |#R_0028|"],["<mizuki.sad.right>おかしいわね。時間に遅れるような子じゃないのに|#M_0046|","<mizuki.sad.right>That's weird. He's not the kind of guy who's late for the time |#M_0046|"],["\\n<市民> 美月さん！ 烈火さん！ 大変です！","\\n<市民> Mizuki-san! Rekka-san! It's difficult!"],["EV034","EV034"],["イベントは正常に動作しますか？","Does the event work properly?"],["EV035","EV035"],["enemy_id : 13","enemy_id : 13"],["RespawnPoint","RespawnPoint"],["RespawnPointの設定方法:\nイベント名「RespawnPoint」にプレイヤーを復活させます。\n追加の設定は必要ありません。\n下記の条件式に「場所移動」を追加することで死亡時にマップを移動させることもできます。","How to set up RespawnPoint:\nRevive the player to the event name \"RespawnPoint.\"\nNo additional configuration is required.\nYou can also move the map on death by adding \"location\" to the conditional expression below."],["プレイヤー死亡時に遷移させたいマップを指定してください。\nこのイベント上に復活させたい場合は何も指定しないでください。\n\n場所移動はTAIMA_Battle_Respawn.jsから読み出されます。\n通常の決定ボタンでエリア遷移しないように\n「絶対に満たさないであろう条件式」で無害化しています。","Please specify the map you want to transition to when the player dies.\nIf you want to revive this event, do not specify anything.\n\nLocation redirection is read from TAIMA_Battle_Respawn.js.\nAvoid changing area using the normal decision button\nIt has been harmless with \"conditional expressions that would never be satisfied.\""],[null,null,null,null,null]],"context":[["Map002/note"],["Map002/events/1/name"],["Map002/events/1/pages/0/list/3/message/noPicture/bottom","Map002/events/4/pages/0/list/3/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map002/events/1/pages/0/list/7/message/noPicture/bottom","Map002/events/1/pages/0/list/11/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map002/events/2/name"],["Map002/events/2/pages/1/list/0/comment","Map002/events/3/pages/0/list/0/comment","Map002/events/5/pages/0/list/0/comment","Map002/events/6/pages/0/list/0/comment","Map002/events/16/pages/0/list/0/comment","Map002/events/17/pages/0/list/0/comment","Map002/events/19/pages/0/list/0/comment","Map002/events/27/pages/1/list/0/comment"],["Map002/events/3/name"],["Map002/events/4/name"],["Map002/events/4/pages/0/list/6/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map002/events/5/name"],["Map002/events/6/name"],["Map002/events/7/name"],["Map002/events/7/pages/0/list/1/Plugin Command"],["Map002/events/7/pages/0/list/9/Plugin Command"],["Map002/events/8/name"],["Map002/events/9/name","Map002/events/10/name","Map002/events/20/name"],["Map002/events/9/pages/0/list/0/comment"],["Map002/events/9/pages/0/list/1/comment","Map002/events/35/pages/0/list/1/comment"],["Map002/events/10/pages/0/list/0/comment","Map002/events/20/pages/0/list/0/comment"],["Map002/events/10/pages/0/list/1/comment","Map002/events/20/pages/0/list/1/comment"],["Map002/events/10/pages/0/list/2/comment","Map002/events/20/pages/0/list/2/comment"],["Map002