2"],["EV033","EV033"],["EV034","EV034"],["<sesiria.idle.right>あの、このショーにでるには\nどうすればいいのですか？","<sesiria.idle.right>Um, how to appear at this show\nWhat should I do?"],["\\n<魔族>あ？","\\n<魔族>Huh?"],["\\n<魔族>んなもん招待券を使うにきまってんだろ","\\n<魔族>You're probably going to use your own invitation ticket"],["<sesiria.idle.right>その招待券はどうやって\n手に入れるのですか？","<sesiria.idle.right>How do you make that invitation ticket?\nDo you get it?"],["\\n<魔族>くく\nあんた招待券が欲しいのか\nまぁ確かに効率的に客をとれるようになるからな","\\n<魔族>\nDo you want an invitation ticket?\nWell, it's certainly possible to get customers efficiently."],["\\n<魔族>まぁ大富豪の客や凄腕の娼婦は娼館側から\n渡されるらしいぜ","\\n<魔族>Well, millionaire customers and skilled prostitutes are from the brothel side.\nApparently it's handed over"],["<sesiria.idle.right>そうなんですね・・・\n簡単に手に入る物ではないのですね・・・","<sesiria.idle.right>That's right...\nIt's not something that's easy to get..."],["\\n<魔族>ま、ちょうどここに一枚あるんだけどな","\\n<魔族> Well, there's one here"],["<sesiria.idle.right>・・・！\nどうかその招待券を譲っていただくことは\nできないでしょうか？","<sesiria.idle.right>...!\nPlease give me that invitation ticket\nCan't you do it?"],["\\n<魔族>くく普通は無理って突っぱねるところなんだが\nあんたみたいな聖職者の娼婦なんて\nはじめてだしな","\\n<魔族> is something that usually forces you to say it's impossible.\nA clergyman like you\nIt's my first time"],["\\n<魔族>俺の要求を飲んでくれたら良いぜ","\\n<魔族>I wish you could drink my request"],["\\n<魔族>２階のプレイルームにきな\n俺を楽しませてくれたら招待券はくれてやるよ","\\n<魔族>Kinna in the playroom on the 2nd floor\nIf you entertain me, I'll give you an invitation ticket"],["<sesiria.idle.right>・・・わかりました","<sesiria.idle.right>...I understand"],["EV035","EV035"],["EV036","EV036"],["EV037","EV037"],["EV038","EV038"]],"context":[["Map027/displayName"],["Map027/note"],["Map027/events/1/name"],["Map027/events/1/pages/0/list/0/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map027/events/1/pages/0/list/2/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map027/events/2/name"],["Map027/events/2/pages/0/list/0/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map027/events/2/pages/0/list/3/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map027/events/3/name"],["Map027/events/3/pag