されるといいわ！|#A_0037|":68,"\\n<魔族A>はははっ！ お前の母親に何ができる！？":69,"わたしのママは 最強のS級対魔戦士よ・・・！|#A_0038|":70,"\\n<魔族A>！！！":71,"それに 対魔戦士のみんなも\n私を助けに来てくれる・・・絶対に！|#A_0039|":72,"\\n<魔族A>ククク・・・ 望むところだ":73,"\\n<魔族A>だが それまでお前は理性を保っていられるかな？":74,"\\n<魔族A>奴隷娼婦の調教を あまく見るんじゃないぞ？":75,"くっ・・・|#A_0040|":76,"\\n<あかり>(ママ・・・助けて・・・！)|#A_0041|":77,"自動実行終了後":78,"DAEMON_A":79},"extension":"json","dataType":"map","filename":"Map095","basename":"Map095.json","path":"data/Map095.json","relPath":"data/Map095.json","dirname":"/data","originalFormat":"RPG MAKER MV RAW DATA","lineBreak":"\n","type":"","indexIsBuilt":false,"progress":{"translated":80,"length":80,"percent":100}},"data/Map096.json":{"data":[["<cm:map02_collision>\nLAYER_S 1 map02_base 0 0 255 1 0\nLAYER_S 4 map02_upper 0 0 255 5 0","<cm:map02_collision>\nLAYER_S 1 map02_base 0 0 255 1 0\nLAYER_S 4 map02_upper 0 0 255 5 0"],["EV001","EV001"],["烈火","Revive"],["美月","Mizuki"],["CAM EVENT 004","CAM EVENT 004"],["<mizuki.angry.right>・・・　烈火ちゃん　いま何か聞こえなかった？ |#M_0001|","<mizuki.angry.right>... Rekka-chan, did you not hear anything just? |#M_0001|"],["<rekka.idle.left>ん？アタシは何も聞こえなかったぜ　美月姉 |#R_0001|","<rekka.idle.left>Huh? I couldn't hear anything Mizuki-nee |#R_0001|"],["<mizuki.sad.right>私の気のせいかしら・・・|#M_0002|","<mizuki.sad.right>I wonder if it's just my imagination...|#M_0002|"],["<mizuki.angry.right>それと烈火ちゃん　美月姉って呼び方　いいかげん直してよね|#M_0003|","<mizuki.angry.right>And Rekka-chan, how you call him Mizuki-nee, you're just fine with it, right|#M_0003|"],["<mizuki.idle.right>いつも言ってるでしょ？ 美月でいいわよ、美月で|#M_0004|","<mizuki.idle.right>You're always saying it, right? Mizuki is fine, Mizuki |#M_0004|"],["<rekka.happy.left>そういうわけにはいかねぇっすよ |#R_0002|","<rekka.happy.left>That's not possible |#R_0002|"],["<rekka.idle.left>自分より8個も上のアラフォー近い\n美月姉さんのこと呼び捨てにはできねえっす|#R_0003|","<rekka.idle.left>I'm closer to my 40s, 8 more than me\nYou can't call Mizuki-nee-san |#R_0003|"],["<mizuki.sad.right>烈火ちゃん・・・\n呼び捨てより失礼なこと言ってるからね・・・？|#M_0005|","<mizuki.sad.right>Rekka-chan...\nIt's more rude than calling you out...? |#M_0005|"],["<mizuki.idle.right>まあいいわ　とにかく　\nパトロールを終わらせちゃいましょう|#M_0006|","<mizuki.idle.right>It's fine anyway\nLet's finish the patrol|#M_0006|"],["<mizuki.idle.right>どうやら今日も困っている人がたくさんいるみたいだわ|#M_0007|","<mizuki.idle.right>It seems there are many people who are in trouble today as well|#M_0007|"],["<rekka.idle.left>私たち対魔戦士の出番っすね！|#R_0004|","<rekka.idle.left>We are anti-demon warriors! |#R_0004|"],["<mizuki.happy.right>フフ　烈火ちゃんはいつも元気ね　それじゃあ、始めましょうか|#M_0008|","<mizuki.happy.right>Hehe, Rekka-chan is always doing well. So let's start, shall we? |#M_0008|"],["自動実行イベント終了後","After the automatic execution event ends"]],"context":[["Map096/note"],["Map096/events/1/name"],["Map096/events/3/name"],["Map096/events/4/name"],["Map096/events/4/pages/0/list/2/Plugin Command"],["Map096/events/4/pages/0/list/13/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map096/events/4/pages/0/list/17/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map096/events/4/pages/0/list/19/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map096/events/4/pages/0/list/21/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map096/events/4/pages/0/list/23/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map096/events/4/pages/0/list/25/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map096/events/4/pages/0/list/27/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map096/events/4/pages/0/list/30/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map096/events/4/pages/0/list/33/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map096/events/4/pages/0/list/36/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map096/events/4/pages/0/list/38/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map096/events/4/pages/0/list/40/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map096/events/4/pages/1/list/0/comment"]],"tags":[[],["gold"],["gold"],["gold"],["red"],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],["blue"]],"parameters":[[],[],[],[],[],[{"headerIndex":13,"headerParam":["",0,0,2]}],[{"headerIndex":17,"headerParam":["",0,0,2]}],[{"headerIndex":19,"headerParam":["",0,0,2]}],[{"headerIndex":21,"headerParam":["",0,0,2]}],[{"headerIndex":23,"headerParam":["",0,0,2]}],[{"headerIndex":25,"headerParam":["",0,0,2]}],[{"headerIndex":27,"headerParam":["",0,0,2]}],[{"headerIndex":30,"headerParam":["",0,0,2]}],[{"headerIndex":33,"headerParam":["",0,0,2]}],[{"headerIndex":36,"headerParam":["",0,0,2]}],[{"headerIndex":38,"headerParam":["",0,0,2]}],[{"headerIndex":40,"headerParam":["",0,0,2]}],[{"headerIndex":0,"headerParam":["自動実行イベント終了後"]}]],"indexIds":{"<cm:map02_collision>\nLAYER_S 1 map02_base 0 0 255 1 0\nLAYER_S 4 map02_upper 0 0 255 5 0":0,"EV001":1,"烈火":2,"美月":3,"CAM EVENT 004":4,"<mizuki.angry.right>・・・　烈火ちゃん　いま何か聞こえなかった？ |#M_0001|":5,"<rekka.idle.left>ん？アタシは何も聞こえなかったぜ　美月姉 |#R_0001|":6,"<mizuki.sad.right>私の気のせいかしら・・・|#M_0002|":7,"<mizuki.angry.right>それと烈火ちゃん　美月姉って呼び方　いいかげん直してよね|#M_0003|":8,"<mizuki.idle.right>いつも言ってるでしょ？ 美月でいいわよ、美月で|#M_0004|":9,"<rekka.happy.left>そういうわけにはいかねぇっすよ |#R_0002|":10,"<rekka.idle.left>自分より8個も上のアラフォー近い\n美月姉さんのこと呼び捨てにはできねえっす|#R_0003|":11,"<mizuki.sad.right>烈火ちゃん・・・\n呼び捨てより失礼なこと言ってるからね・・・？|#M_0005|":12,"<mizuki.idle.right>まあいいわ　とにかく　\nパトロールを終わらせちゃいましょう|#M_0006|":13,"<mizuki.idle.right>どうやら今日も困っている人がたくさんいるみたいだわ|#M_0007|":14,"<rekka.idle.left>私たち対魔戦士の出番っすね！|#R_0004|":15,"<mizuki.happy.right>フフ　烈火ちゃんはいつも元気ね　それじゃあ、始めましょうか|#M_0008|":16,"自動実行イベント終了後":17},"extension":"json","dataType":"map","filename":"Map096","basename":"Map096.json","path":"data/Map096.json","relPath":"data/Map096.json","dirname":"/data","originalFormat":"RPG MAKER MV RAW DATA","lineBreak":"\n","type":"","indexIsBuilt":false,"progress":{"translated":18,"length":18,"percent":100}},"data/Map097.json":{"data":[["EV001","EV001"],["街の探索を完了しました。","We have completed our exploration of the city."],["次のシーンに移動します。バトルへ。","Move to the next scene. Going to the battle."],["EV002","EV002"]],"context":[["Map097/events/1/name"],["Map097/events/1/pages/0/list/0/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map097/events/1/pages/0/list/2/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map097/events/2/name"]],"tags":[["gold"],[],[],["gold"]],"parameters":[[],[{"headerIndex":0,"headerParam":["",0,0,2]}],[{"headerIndex":2,"headerParam":["",0,0,2]}],[]],"indexIds":{"EV001":0,"街の探索を完了しました。":1,"次のシーンに移動します。バトルへ。":2,"EV002":3},"extension":"json","dataType":"map","filename":"Map097","basename":"Map097.json","path":"data/Map097.json","relPath":"data/Map097.json","dirname":"/data","originalFormat":"RPG MAKER MV RAW DATA","lineBreak":"\n","type":"","indexIsBuilt":false,"progress":{"translated":4,"length":4,"percent":100}},"data/Map098.json":{"data":[["LAYER_S 1 map03_base 0 0 255 1 0\nLAYER 6 map03_envTexture -1 -1 255 2 0 2 2","LAYER_S 1 map03_base 0 0 255 1 0\nLAYER 6 map03_envTexture -1 -1 255 2 0 2 2"],["RespawnPoint","RespawnPoint"],["RespawnPointの設定方法:\nイベント名「RespawnPoint」にプレイヤーを復活させます。\n追加の設定は必要ありません。\n下記の条件式に「場所移動」を追加することで死亡時にマップを移動させることもできます。","How to set up RespawnPoint:\nRevive the player to the event name \"RespawnPoint.\"\nNo additional configuration is required.\nYou can also move the map on death by adding \"location\" to the conditional expression below."],["プレイヤー死亡時に遷移させたいマップを指定してください。\nこのイベント上に復活させたい場合は何も指定しないでください。\n\n場所移動はTAIMA_Battle_Respawn.jsから読み出されます。\n通常の決定ボタンでエリア遷移しないように\n「絶対に満たさないであろう条件式」で無害化しています。","Please specify the map you want to transition to when the player dies.\nIf you want to revive this event, do not specify anything.\n\nLocation redirection is read from TAIMA_Battle_Respawn.js.\nAvoid changing area using the normal decision button\nIt has been harmless with \"conditional expressions that would never be satisfied.\""],["管理イベント_03","Management Event _03"],["EVENT ID\n006: 対魔戦士\n003: DAEMON A\n004: DAEMON B\n005: DAEMON C\n007: 倒れた少女","EVENT ID\n006: Anti-Demon Warrior\n003: DAEMON A\n004: DAEMON B\n005: DAEMON C\n007: The fallen girl"],["CAM EVENT 006","CAM EVENT 006"],["市街地 駅前 10分前","City area: 10 minutes before station"],["<mobTaima.angry.right>動かないで！","<mobTaima.angry.right>Don't move!"],["CAM EVENT 003","CAM EVENT 003"],["\\n<魔族>ったく、しつこい対魔戦士だな！","\\n<魔族>, you're a persistent anti-magic warrior!"],["\\n<魔族>俺たちは そこの姉ちゃんをスカウトしてただけなのに","\\n<魔族>We were just scouting that sister."],["<mobTaima.angry.right>嘘つかないで！ 強引に連れて行こうとしてたくせに！","<mobTaima.angry.right>Don't lie! Even though I was trying to force him to take him!"],["<mobTaima.angry.right>あなたたちが 誘拐事件の犯人なんでしょ！","<mobTaima.angry.right>You guys are the culprits in the kidnapping case, right?"],["\\n<魔族>そ、そんなわけねえだろ！？","\\n<魔族>That's not the case! ?"],["\\n<魔族>魔族のくせに嘘が下手ね！","\\n<魔族>Even though he's a demon, he's not good at lying!"],["\\n<魔族>全員ここで逮捕するわ！","\\n<魔族>All of them are arrested here!"],["CAM EVENT 007","CAM EVENT 007"],["\\n<魔族>ごちゃごちゃウルセエな！\nやれるもんならやってみやがれ！","\\n<魔族>A messy, ugly!\nIf you can, give it a try!"],["\\n<魔族B>ぼ、ボス！これ以上騒ぎを大きくしちゃだめです！","\\n<魔族B>Bo, boss! Don't make any more noise!"],["\\n<魔族C>そうっすよ！この前も秋崎さんに怒られたじゃないっすか！","\\n<魔族C>That's right! The other day, Akizaki-san scolded me too!"],["\\n<魔族>うるせえぞテメエら！","\\n<魔族>Shut up, everyone!"],["\\n<魔族>こんなザコ対魔戦士にビビってんじゃねえ！","\\n<魔族>I'm not scared of a weak-headed warrior like this!"],["\\n<魔族>さっさと倒しちまえば良いんだよ！","You can just defeat \\n<魔族> quickly!"],["自動実行終了後","After automatic execution ends"],["DAEMON_A","DAEMON_A"],["DAEMON_B","DAEMON_B"],["DAEMON_C","DAEMON_C"],["対魔戦士A","Anti-Demon Warrior A"],["EV007","EV007"]],"context":[["Map098/note"],["Map098/events/1/name"],["Map098/events/1/pages/0/list/0/comment"],["Map098/events/1/pages/0/list/4/comment"],["Map098/events/2/name"],["Map098/events/2/pages/0/list/0/comment"],["Map098/events/2/pages/0/list/8/Plugin Command","Map098/events/2/pages/0/list/27/Plugin Command","Map098/events/2/pages/0/list/41/Plugin Command"],["Map098/events/2/pages/0/list/9/message/noPicture/middle"],["Map098/events/2/pages/0/list/17/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map098/events/2/pages/0/list/22/Plugin Command","Map098/events/2/pages/0/list/34/Plugin Command"],["Map098/events/2/pages/0/list/23/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map098/events/2/pages/0/list/25/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map098/events/2/pages/0/list/29/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map098/events/2/pages/0/list/31/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map098/events/2/pages/0/list/36/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map098/events/2/pages/0/list/42/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map098/events/2/pages/0/list/44/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map098/events/2/pages/0/list/46/Plugin Command"],["Map098/events/2/pages/0/list/48/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map098/events/2/pages/0/list/57/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map098/events/2/pages/0/list/59/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map098/events/2/pages/0/list/63/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map098/events/2/pages/0/list/65/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map098/events/2/pages/0/list/69/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map098/events/2/pages/1/list/0/comment"],["Map098/events/3/name"],["Map098/events/4/name"],["Map098/events/5/name"],["Map098/events/6/name"],["Map098/events/7/name"]],"tags":[[],["gold"],["blue"],["blue"],["gold"],["blue"],["red"],[],[],["red"],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],["red"],[],[],[],[],[],[],["blue"],["gold"],["gold"],["gold"],["gold"],["gold"]],"parameters":[[],[],[{"headerIndex":0,"headerParam":["RespawnPointの設定方法:"]}],[{"headerIndex":4,"headerParam":["プレイヤー死亡時に遷移させたいマップを指定してください。"]}],[],[{"headerIndex":0,"headerParam":["EVENT ID"]}],[],[{"headerIndex":9,"headerParam":["",0,1,1]}],[{"headerIndex":17,"headerParam":["",0,0,2]}],[],[{"headerIndex":23,"headerParam":["",0,0,2]}],[{"headerIndex":25,"headerParam":["",0,0,2]}],[{"headerIndex":29,"headerParam":["",0,0,2]}],[{"headerIndex":31,"headerParam":["",0,0,2]}],[{"headerIndex":36,"headerParam":["",0,0,2]}],[{"headerIndex":42,"headerParam":["",0,0,2]}],[{"headerIndex":44,"headerParam":["",0,0,2]}],[],[{"headerIndex":48,"headerParam":["",0,0,2]}],[{"headerIndex":57,"headerParam":["",0,0,2]}],[{"headerIndex":59,"headerParam":["",0,0,2]}],[{"headerIndex":63,"headerParam":["",0,0,2]}],[{"headerIndex":65,"headerParam":["",0,0,2]}],[{"headerIndex":69,"headerParam":["",0,0,2]}],[{"headerIndex":0,"headerParam":["自動実行終了後"]}],[],[],[],[],[]],"indexIds":{"LAYER_S 1 map03_base 0 0 255 1 0\nLAYER 6 map03_envTexture -1 -1 255 2 0 2 2":0,"RespawnPoint":1,"RespawnPointの設定方法:\nイベント名「RespawnPoint」にプレイヤーを復活させます。\n追加の設定は必要ありません。\n下記の条件式に「場所移動」を追加することで死亡時にマップを移動させることもできます。":2,"プレイヤー死亡時に遷移させたいマップを指定してください。\nこのイベント上に復活させたい場合は何も指定しないでください。\n\n場所移動はTAIMA_Battle_Respawn.jsから読み出されます。\n通常の決定ボタンでエリア遷移しないように\n「絶対に満たさないであろう条件式」で無害化しています。":3,"管理イベント_03":4,"EVENT ID\n006: 対魔戦士\n003: DAEMON A\n004: DAEMON B\n005: DAEMON C\n007: 倒れた少女":5,"CAM EVENT 006":6,"市街地 駅前 10分前":7,"<mobTaima.angry.right>動かないで！":8,"CAM EVENT 003":9,"\\n<魔族>ったく、しつこい対魔戦士だな！":10,"\\n<魔族>俺たちは そこの姉ちゃんをスカウトしてただけなのに":11,"<mobTaima.angry.right>嘘つかないで！ 強引に連れて行こうとしてたくせに！":12,"<mobTaima.angry.right>あなたたちが 誘拐事件の犯人なんでしょ！":13,"\\n<魔族>そ、そんなわけねえだろ！？":14,"\\n<魔族>魔族のくせに嘘が下手ね！":15,"\\n<魔族>全員ここで逮捕するわ！":16,"CAM EVENT 007":17,"\\n<魔族>ごちゃごちゃウルセエな！\nやれるもんならやってみやがれ！":18,"\\n<魔族B>ぼ、ボス！これ以上騒ぎを大きくしちゃだめです！":19,"\\n<魔族C>そうっすよ！この前も秋崎さんに怒られたじゃないっすか！":20,"\\n<魔族>うるせえぞテメエら！":21,"\\n<魔族>こんなザコ対魔戦士にビビってんじゃねえ！":22,"\\n<魔族>さっさと倒しちまえば良いんだよ！":23,"自動実行終了後":24,"DAEMON_A":25,"DAEMON_B":26,"DAEMON_C":27,"対魔戦士A":28,"EV007":29},"extension":"json","dataType":"map","filename":"Map098","basename":"Map098.json","path":"data/Map098.json","relPath":"data/Map098.json","dirname":"/data","originalFormat":"RPG MAKER MV RAW DATA","lineBreak":"\n","type":"","indexIsBuilt":false,"progress":{"translated":30,"length":30,"percent":100}},"data/Map099.json":{"data":[["美月の家","Mizuki's House"],["<Player:mizuki>\nLAYER_S 1 map04_base 0 0 255 1 0","<Player:mizuki>\nLAYER_S 1 map04_base 0 0 255 1 0"],["EV001","EV001"],["夫との会話完了後に有効化\n接触したらセシリア教会イベントに遷移","Enabled after the conversation with your husband is completed\nOnce we get in touch, we move to the Cecilia Church event."],["娼館に向かいますか？","Are you heading to the brothel?"],["はい","yes"],["いいえ","no"],["\\n<美月>(魔族娼館・・・)|#M_0111|","\\n<Mizuki> (Demon Brothel...)|#M_0111|"],["\\n<美月>(あの建物が怪しいことは対魔戦士なら\n誰でも分かってた・・・)|#M_0112|","\\n<Mizuki> (If that building is suspicious, then it's a demon warrior\nEveryone knew...)|#M_0112|"],["\\n<美月>(何度捜査しようとしても 魔族が拒否し続けてきた・・・)|#M_0114|","\\n<Mizuki> (No matter how many times I try to investigate, the demons keep refusing...)|#M_0114|"],["\\n<美月>(まさかこんな形で潜入することになるなんて・・・)|#M_0115|","\\n<Mizuki> (I never thought I'd be infiltrating like this...)|#M_0115|"],["\\n<美月>(あかり待っててね・・・必ず助け出すわ)|#M_0116|","\\n<Mizuki> (Akari wait... I'll definitely save you)|#M_0116|"],["美月夫(002)","Mizukio (002)"],["[物語]夫に別れを告げる美月","[物語]Mizuki says goodbye to her husband"],["<mizuki.sad.left>ねえ あなた・・・|#M_0100|","<mizuki.sad.left>Hey you...|#M_0100|"],["\\n<夫>おお 美月！帰ったのか！","\\n<夫>Oh Mizuki! Have you gone home!"],["\\n<夫>あかりは一緒じゃないのか？","\\n<夫> Isn't Akari the same?"],["<mizuki.sad.left>ええ あの子は泊まり込みで訓練をしてるわ\n対魔戦士の本部で・・・|#M_0101|","<mizuki.sad.left>Yeah, that girl is training overnight.\nAt the Headquarters of the Demon Warrior...|#M_0101|"],["\\n<夫>そうなのか！さすがだな！\n本当に真面目な子だ","\\n<夫>Is that so? As expected!\nHe's a really serious kid"],["<mizuki.sad.left>うん あの子はすごく頑張ってる・・・|#M_0102|","<mizuki.sad.left>Yeah, that girl is working so hard...|#M_0102|"],["\\n<夫>将来は君と同じ S級対魔戦士になって\n多くの人を助けるんだろうな！","\\n<夫> In the future, you will become the same S-class demon warrior\nI'm sure it'll help a lot of people!"],["<mizuki.sad.left>ええ そうね|#M_0103|","<mizuki.sad.left>Yes, yes|#M_0103|"],["<mizuki.sad.left>あなた じつは私 これから仕事があるの|#M_0104|","<mizuki.sad.left>You actually, I have work to go on |#M_0104|"],["\\n<夫>これから？ もう夜になるぞ？","\\n<夫>Now? It's going to be night already?"],["<mizuki.sad.left>とても大切な仕事なの|#M_0105|","<mizuki.sad.left>It's a very important job |#M_0105|"],["<mizuki.sad.left>それと もしかしたら\nしばらく家に帰れないかもしれない・・・|#M_0106|","<mizuki.sad.left>And maybe\nI might not be able to go home for a while...|#M_0106|"],["\\n<夫>・・・！","\\n<夫>...!"],["\\n<夫>難しい仕事 なのか・・・？","\\n<夫>Is this a difficult job...?"],["<mizuki.sad.left>ええ とても難しい仕事|#M_0107|","<mizuki.sad.left>Yeah, very difficult work|#M_0107|"],["\\n<夫>・・・わかった だが無理はしないでくれよ美月","\\n<夫>...I understand, but don't push yourself too hard, Mizuki"],["<mizuki.idle.left>ええ|#M_0108|","<mizuki.idle.left>Yeah|#M_0108|"],["\\n<夫>美月・・・","\\n<夫> Mizuki..."],["<mizuki.idle.left>あなた・・・","<mizuki.idle.left>You..."],["\n   　　　　　　チュッ♡","\n   Chew♡"],["んっ・・・","Hmm..."],["\\n<夫>愛してる","\\n<夫> I love you"],["わたしも|#M_0109|","Me too|#M_0109|"],["\\n<夫>無事に帰ってこいよ","\\n<夫> Come back safely"],["\\n<美月>ええ・・・","\\n<Mizuki> Yes..."],["ストーリー会話終了時","When the story conversation ends"],["\\n<夫>頑張ってこいよ 美月","\\n<夫> Good luck with Mizuki"],["\\n<夫>応援してる","I'm rooting for \\n<夫>"],["EV003","EV003"],["管理イベント_03","Management Event _03"],["EVENT ID\n002: 美月夫","EVENT ID\n002: Mizukio"],["CAM PLAYER","CAM PLAYER"],["\\n<美月>(あかり・・・あんなひどい目にあってるなんて・・・)|#M_0096|","\\n<Mizuki> (Akari... I can't believe you're going through such a terrible thing...)|#M_0096|"],["\\n<美月>(いますぐ助けに行きたいけど\nいまはあの魔族を待つことしかできない・・・)|#M_0097|","\\n<Mizuki> (I want to go and help now though\nNow I can only wait for that demon...)|#M_0097|"],["CAM EVENT 002","CAM EVENT 002"],["\\n<美月>(しばらく家に帰れないかもしれない\nあのひとに伝えておかないと・・・)|#M_0099|","\\n<Mizuki> (maybe I won't be able to go home for a while\nI have to tell that person...)|#M_0099|"],["自動実行イベントの完了","Autorun event completion"],["EV005","EV005"],["EV006","EV006"],["あかりの食べかけのお菓子だ・・・","It's a freshly eaten snack from Akari..."],["帰ってきたらうんと叱ってあげないと・・・","I have to scold him when I get back..."],["EV007","EV007"],["昨日、夫と飲んでいたワインだ・・・","The wine I was drinking with my husband yesterday..."],["EV008","EV008"],["あかりの飲みかけのジュースだ・・・","It's a freshly drunk juice..."],["最後の一口分だけが残されている・・・","Only the last bite is left..."],["EV009","EV009"],["烈火ちゃんから貰った果物だ・・・","It's the fruit I received from Rekka..."],["祝！歴代二人目のS級対魔戦士と書かれている・・・","Congratulations! It is said to be the second S-class anti-magic warrior in history..."],["EV010","EV010"],["家族写真だ・・・","It's a family photo..."],["幼いあかりが\nひまわりを頭に乗せて笑っている・・・","Young Akari\nI'm laughing with a sunflower on my head..."],["EV011","EV011"],["EV012","EV012"],["EV013","EV013"],["EV014","EV014"],["EV015","EV015"],["EV016","EV016"],["EV017","EV017"],["EV018","EV018"],["EV019","EV019"],["EV020","EV020"],["EV021","EV021"],["EV022","