ら向かう魔族娼館・・・\nそこでどんな目に会おうとも・・・|#S_0034|","<sesiria.angry.left>The demon brothel you're heading to...\nNo matter what you meet there...|#S_0034|"],["<sesiria.angry.left>私はアリス教徒として\n己の純潔を守り通すことを誓います・・・|#S_0035|","<sesiria.angry.left>I am an Alice\nI vow to protect my own chastity...|#S_0035|"],["CAM EVENT 002 1600","CAM EVENT 002 1600"],["<sesiria.angry.left>まさか この秘術を使う日が来るとは・・・|#S_0036|","<sesiria.angry.left>I can't believe the day will come when I use this secret technique...|#S_0036|"],["<sesiria.angry.left>でも 仕方がありません・・・|#S_0037|","<sesiria.angry.left>, but there's nothing I can do...|#S_0037|"],["対魔の力がセシリアの下腹部に集まる・・・","The power of the anti-magic gathers on Cecilia's lower abdomen..."],["<sesiria.sad.left>聖女の純潔を守るため・・・|#S_0038|","<sesiria.sad.left>To protect the saint's chastity...|#S_0038|"],["<sesiria.sad.left>秘部に結界を張る アリス教の秘術・・・|#S_0039|","<sesiria.sad.left>Alice's secret technique to set a barrier in secret...|#S_0039|"],["\\n<セシリア>お許しください アリス様・・・|#S_0040|","\\n<Cecilia> Please forgive me Alice...|#S_0040|"],["<sesiria.idle.left>ふう・・・ そろそろ行かなくては|#S_0041|","<sesiria.idle.left>Heh... I have to go soon|#S_0041|"],["<sesiria.angry.left>あかりちゃんを あれ以上ひどい目に\nあわせるわけにはいかない・・・！|#S_0042|","<sesiria.angry.left>Akari-chan is getting worse than that\nWe can't meet...! |#S_0042|"],["<sesiria.angry.left>それに・・・|#S_0043|","<sesiria.angry.left>And...|#S_0043|"],["<sesiria.angry.left>魔族娼館・・・|#S_0044|","<sesiria.angry.left>Demon Brothel...|#S_0044|"],["<sesiria.angry.left>ついに このときが来たのですね|#S_0045|","<sesiria.angry.left>It's finally time |#S_0045|"],["<sesiria.angry.left>どこを探しても見つからなかった・・・|#S_0046|","<sesiria.angry.left>I couldn't find it no matter where I searched...|#S_0046|"],["<sesiria.angry.left>もう 唯一残されたのは あの建物だけなのです|#S_0047|","<sesiria.angry.left>The only thing left is that building|#S_0047|"],["<sesiria.angry.left>だからこれが 私にとっての最後の希望・・・|#S_0048|","<sesiria.angry.left>So this is my last hope...|#S_0048|"],["\\n<セシリア>心から再会できることを願っています・・・|#S_0049|","\\n<Cecilia>I sincerely hope to be able to meet again...|#S_0049|"],["\\n<セシリア>お母様・・・！|#S_0050|","\\n<Cecilia>Mom...! |#S_0050|"],["自動実行イベントの完了","Autorun event completion"],["セシリア","Cecilia"],["カメラ開始座標(003)","Camera start coordinates (003)"],["イベントカメラ座標(004)","Event Camera Coordinates (004)"]],"context":[["Map100/displayName"],["Map100/note"],["Map100/events/1/name"],["Map100/events/1/pages/0/list/0/comment"],["Map100/events/1/pages/0/list/5/Plugin Command"],["Map100/events/1/pages/0/list/11/message/noPicture/middle"],["Map100/events/1/pages/0/list/13/Plugin Command"],["Map100/events/1/pages/0/list/18/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map100/events/1/pages/0/list/20/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map100/events/1/pages/0/list/23/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map100/events/1/pages/0/list/28/Plugin Command"],["Map100/events/1/pages/0/list/33/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map100/events/1/pages/0/list/35/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map100/events/1/pages/0/list/42/message/noPicture/middle"],["Map100/events/1/pages/0/list/45/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map100/events/1/pages/0/list/47/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map100/events/1/pages/0/list/52/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map100/events/1/pages/0/list/61/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map100/events/1/pages/0/list/63/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map100/events/1/pages/0/list/66/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map100/events/1/pages/0/list/68/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map100/events/1/pages/0/list/70/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map100/events/1/pages/0/list/72/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map100/events/1/pages/0/list/74/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map100/events/1/pages/0/list/76/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map100/events/1/pages/0/list/80/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map100/events/1/pages/0/list/82/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map100/events/1/pages/1/list/0/comment"],["Map100/events/2/name"],["Map100/events/3/name"],["Map100/events/4/name"]],"tags":[[],[],["gold"],["blue"],["red"],[],["red"],[],[],[],["red"],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],["blue"],[