wnPoint:\nRevive the player to the event name \"RespawnPoint.\"\nNo additional configuration is required.\nYou can also move the map on death by adding \"location\" to the conditional expression below."],["プレイヤー死亡時に遷移させたいマップを指定してください。\nこのイベント上に復活させたい場合は何も指定しないでください。\n\n場所移動はTAIMA_Battle_Respawn.jsから読み出されます。\n通常の決定ボタンでエリア遷移しないように\n「絶対に満たさないであろう条件式」で無害化しています。","Please specify the map you want to transition to when the player dies.\nIf you want to revive this event, do not specify anything.\n\nLocation redirection is read from TAIMA_Battle_Respawn.js.\nAvoid changing area using the normal decision button\nIt has been harmless with \"conditional expressions that would never be satisfied.\""],["EV018","EV018"],["追憶のかけらを手に入れました","I got a piece of remembrance"]],"context":[["Map108/displayName"],["Map108/note"],["Map108/events/1/name"],["Map108/events/2/name"],["Map108/events/3/name"],["Map108/events/4/name"],["Map108/events/5/name"],["Map108/events/6/name"],["Map108/events/7/name"],["Map108/events/8/name"],["Map108/events/9/name"],["Map108/events/10/name"],["Map108/events/11/name"],["Map108/events/12/name"],["Map108/events/13/name"],["Map108/events/14/name"],["Map108/events/15/pages/0/list/2/message/noPicture/middle"],["Map108/events/15/pages/0/list/5/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map108/events/15/pages/0/list/8/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map108/events/15/pages/0/list/11/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map108/events/15/pages/0/list/14/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map108/events/15/pages/0/list/23/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map108/events/15/pages/0/list/32/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map108/events/15/pages/0/list/35/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map108/events/16/name"],["Map108/events/16/pages/1/list/1/message/noPicture/middle"],["Map108/events/17/name"],["Map108/events/17/pages/0/list/0/comment"],["Map108/events/17/pages/0/list/4/comment"],["Map108/events/18/name"],["Map108/events/18/pages/0/list/2/message/noPicture/bottom"]],"tags":[[],[],["gold"],["gold"],["gold"],["gold