_current : Bow":45,"弓矢に変更しました。":46,"RespawnPoint":47,"RespawnPointの設定方法:\nイベント名「RespawnPoint」にプレイヤーを復活させます。\n追加の設定は必要ありません。\n下記の条件式に「場所移動」を追加することで死亡時にマップを移動させることもできます。":48,"プレイヤー死亡時に遷移させたいマップを指定してください。\nこのイベント上に復活させたい場合は何も指定しないでください。\n\n場所移動はTAIMA_Battle_Respawn.jsから読み出されます。\n通常の決定ボタンでエリア遷移しないように\n「絶対に満たさないであろう条件式」で無害化しています。":49,"set_actor_item : 1 : 10":50,"set_actor_item : 2 : 10":51,"set_actor_item : 3 : 10":52,"set_actor_item : 4 : 10":53,"EV026":54,"EV027":55,"EV029":56,"宝を手に入れた！":57,"EV030":58,"EV031":59,"EV032":60,"EV033":61,"EV034":62,"EV035":63,"EV037":64,"EV038":65,"EV039":66,"enemy_id : 13":67,"EV040":68,"EV041":69},"extension":"json","dataType":"map","filename":"Map111","basename":"Map111.json","path":"data/Map111.json","relPath":"data/Map111.json","dirname":"/data","originalFormat":"RPG MAKER MV RAW DATA","lineBreak":"\n","type":"","indexIsBuilt":false,"progress":{"translated":70,"length":70,"percent":100}},"data/Map112.json":{"data":[["LAYER_S 1 map02_base 0 0 255 1 0\nLAYER_S 4 map02_upper 0 0 255 5 0","LAYER_S 1 map02_base 0 0 255 1 0\nLAYER_S 4 map02_upper 0 0 255 5 0"],["EV001","EV001"],["美月","Mizuki"],["イベントID\n003: 烈火\n004: 美月\n006: NPC","Event ID\n003: Retsuka\n004: Mizuki\n006: NPC"],["<mizuki.idle.right>お疲れ様、烈火ちゃん。\n今日のパトロールはこれで終わりね |#M_0043|","<mizuki.idle.right>Thank you for your hard work, Rekka-chan.\nThat's all for today's patrol |#M_0043|"],["<mizuki.idle.right>残りは次の子に引き継ぎましょう|#M_0044|","<mizuki.idle.right>Turn the rest to the next child|#M_0044|"],["<rekka.sad.left>うーん・・・|#R_0027|","<rekka.sad.left>Hmm...|#R_0027|"],["<mizuki.sad.right>どうしたの、烈火ちゃん？|#M_0045|","<mizuki.sad.right>What's wrong, Rekka-chan? |#M_0045|"],["<rekka.sad.left>それが・・・次の対魔戦士の子が\n見当たらないんすよね|#R_0028|","<rekka.sad.left>That's... the next anti-magic warrior child\nI can't find it, right? |#R_0028|"],["<mizuki.sad.right>おかしいわね。時間に遅れるような子じゃないのに|#M_0046|","<mizuki.sad.right>That's weird. He's not the kind of guy who's late for the time |#M_0046|"],["\\n<市民> 美月さん！ 烈火さん！ 大変です！","\\n<市民> Mizuki-san! Rekka-san! It's difficult!"],["NPCが息を切らして近づいてくる","The NPC is breathless and approaching"],["CAM EVENT 006","CAM EVENT 006"],["<mizuki.surprise.right>どうしたんですか？ そんなに慌てて|#M_0047|","<mizuki.surprise.right>What's wrong? So panicked|#M_0047|"],["\\n<市民> はぁっ・・・はぁっ・・・","\\n<市民> Haa...haa..."],["\\n<市民> ま、街の向こう側・・・駅前の広場で・・・","\\n<市民> Well, on the other side of town... in the square in front of the station..."],["\\n<市民> 対魔戦士の子が 魔族と戦っていました！","\\n<市民> The anti-demon warrior was fighting the demons!"],["\\n<市民> おねがいです！ 助けに行ってあげてください！","\\n<市民> Please! Please go and help me!"],["<rekka.surprise.left>なんだって！？|#R_0029|","<rekka.surprise.left>What? ? |#R_0029|"],["<mizuki.angry.right>烈火ちゃん、すぐに向かうわよ。\nなんだか悪い予感がするわ|#M_0048|","<mizuki.angry.right>Rekka-chan, I'll head straight away.\nI have a bad feeling |#M_0048|"],["<rekka.angry.left>ええ、行きましょう！美月姉！|#R_0030|","<rekka.angry.left>Yeah, let's go! Mizuki-nee! |#R_0030|"],["<rekka.angry.left>魔族のやつら、ボコボコにしてやります！|#R_0031|","<rekka.angry.left>I'll beat up the demons! |#R_0031|"],["自動実行終了後","After automatic execution ends"],["烈火","Revive"],["NPC","NPC"]],"context":[["Map112/note"],["Map112/events/1/name"],["Map112/events/2/name"],["Map112/events/2/pages/0/list/4/comment"],["Map112/events/2/pages/0/list/11/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map112/events/2/pages/0/list/14/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map112/events/2/pages/0/list/17/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map112/events/2/pages/0/list/20/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map112/events/2/pages/0/list/22/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map112/events/2/pages/0/list/25/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map112/events/2/pages/0/list/27/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map112/events/2/pages/0/list/40/comment"],["Map112/events/2/pages/0/list/41/Plugin Command"],["Map112/events/2/pages/0/list/47/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map112/events/2/pages/0/list/49/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map112/events/2/pages/0/list/51/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map112/events/2/pages/0/list/54/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map112/events/2/pages/0/list/56/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map112/events/2/pages/0/list/58/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map112/events/2/pages/0/list/60/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map112/events/2/pages/0/list/63/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map112/events/2/pages/0/list/65/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map112/events/2/pages/1/list/0/comment"],["Map112/events/5/name"],["Map112/events/6/name"]],"tags":[[],["gold"],["gold"],["blue"],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],["blue"],["red"],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],["blue"],["gold"],["gold"]],"parameters":[[],[],[],[{"headerIndex":4,"headerParam":["イベントID"]}],[{"headerIndex":11,"headerParam":["",0,0,2]}],[{"headerIndex":14,"headerParam":["",0,0,2]}],[{"headerIndex":17,"headerParam":["",0,0,2]}],[{"headerIndex":20,"headerParam":["",0,0,2]}],[{"headerIndex":22,"headerParam":["",0,0,2]}],[{"headerIndex":25,"headerParam":["",0,0,2]}],[{"headerIndex":27,"headerParam":["",0,0,2]}],[{"headerIndex":40,"headerParam":["NPCが息を切らして近づいてくる"]}],[],[{"headerIndex":47,"headerParam":["",0,0,2]}],[{"headerIndex":49,"headerParam":["",0,0,2]}],[{"headerIndex":51,"headerParam":["",0,0,2]}],[{"headerIndex":54,"headerParam":["",0,0,2]}],[{"headerIndex":56,"headerParam":["",0,0,2]}],[{"headerIndex":58,"headerParam":["",0,0,2]}],[{"headerIndex":60,"headerParam":["",0,0,2]}],[{"headerIndex":63,"headerParam":["",0,0,2]}],[{"headerIndex":65,"headerParam":["",0,0,2]}],[{"headerIndex":0,"headerParam":["自動実行終了後"]}],[],[]],"indexIds":{"LAYER_S 1 map02_base 0 0 255 1 0\nLAYER_S 4 map02_upper 0 0 255 5 0":0,"EV001":1,"美月":2,"イベントID\n003: 烈火\n004: 美月\n006: NPC":3,"<mizuki.idle.right>お疲れ様、烈火ちゃん。\n今日のパトロールはこれで終わりね |#M_0043|":4,"<mizuki.idle.right>残りは次の子に引き継ぎましょう|#M_0044|":5,"<rekka.sad.left>うーん・・・|#R_0027|":6,"<mizuki.sad.right>どうしたの、烈火ちゃん？|#M_0045|":7,"<rekka.sad.left>それが・・・次の対魔戦士の子が\n見当たらないんすよね|#R_0028|":8,"<mizuki.sad.right>おかしいわね。時間に遅れるような子じゃないのに|#M_0046|":9,"\\n<市民> 美月さん！ 烈火さん！ 大変です！":10,"NPCが息を切らして近づいてくる":11,"CAM EVENT 006":12,"<mizuki.surprise.right>どうしたんですか？ そんなに慌てて|#M_0047|":13,"\\n<市民> はぁっ・・・はぁっ・・・":14,"\\n<市民> ま、街の向こう側・・・駅前の広場で・・・":15,"\\n<市民> 対魔戦士の子が 魔族と戦っていました！":16,"\\n<市民> おねがいです！ 助けに行ってあげてください！":17,"<rekka.surprise.left>なんだって！？|#R_0029|":18,"<mizuki.angry.right>烈火ちゃん、すぐに向かうわよ。\nなんだか悪い予感がするわ|#M_0048|":19,"<rekka.angry.left>ええ、行きましょう！美月姉！|#R_0030|":20,"<rekka.angry.left>魔族のやつら、ボコボコにしてやります！|#R_0031|":21,"自動実行終了後":22,"烈火":23,"NPC":24},"extension":"json","dataType":"map","filename":"Map112","basename":"Map112.json","path":"data/Map112.json","relPath":"data/Map112.json","dirname":"/data","originalFormat":"RPG MAKER MV RAW DATA","lineBreak":"\n","type":"","indexIsBuilt":false,"progress":{"translated":25,"length":25,"percent":100}},"data/Map113.json":{"data":[["LAYER_S 1 map03_base 0 0 255 1 0\nLAYER 6 map03_envTexture -1 -1 255 2 0 2 2","LAYER_S 1 map03_base 0 0 255 1 0\nLAYER 6 map03_envTexture -1 -1 255 2 0 2 2"],["管理イベント_03","Management Event _03"],["EVENT ID\n006: 対魔戦士\n003: DAEMON A\n004: DAEMON B\n005: DAEMON C\n007: 倒れた少女","EVENT ID\n006: Anti-Demon Warrior\n003: DAEMON A\n004: DAEMON B\n005: DAEMON C\n007: The fallen girl"],["CAM EVENT 003","CAM EVENT 003"],["\\n<対魔戦士A>う・・うう・・・","\\n<対魔戦士A>Uh..."],["\\n<魔族>ぐははっ！ ほら見ただろう！\n対魔戦士なんてザコなんだよ！","\\n<魔族>Guhaha! You'd seen it!\nAnti-Demon Warriors are so unassuming!"],["\\n<魔族B>ボスすげえ！","\\n<魔族B>Boss is amazing!"],["\\n<魔族C>すごいすごい！","\\n<魔族C>Amazing!"],["CAM EVENT 006","CAM EVENT 006"],["\\n<対魔戦士A>そ・・・そんな・・・","\\n<対魔戦士A> That... that..."],["\\n<対魔戦士A>魔族のくせに 対魔の力が効かないなんて・・","\\n<対魔戦士A>Even though they're demons, their powers of anti-magics don't work..."],["\\n<魔族>よーし お前ら！ コイツも娼館に連れてくぞ！","\\n<魔族>Okay, you guys! I'll take him to the brothel too!"],["\\n<魔族B>ええっ！？ 本気ですかボス！？","\\n<魔族B> is ok! ? Are you serious about it? Boss! ?"],["\\n<魔族>対魔戦士は 客に人気があるんだよ","\\n<魔族> Demon Warriors are popular with customers."],["\\n<魔族>秋崎からも褒美がもらえるはずだぜ","\\n<魔族> Akizaki should also receive a reward"],["\\n<対魔戦士>あ あなたたち・・・ さっきから何を言って・・・","\\n<対魔戦士> Ah you guys... What have you been saying..."],["\\n<魔族>ぐはは お前の新しい就職口についてだ","\\n<魔族> Guhaha, it's about your new job opening."],["\\n<魔族>俺たちと一緒に来てもらうぜ","\\n<魔族> Let's come with us"],["\\n<対魔戦士>ぐっ・・・","\\n<対魔戦士>Grr..."],["\\n<対魔戦士>だれか・・・","\\n<対魔戦士> Someone..."],["\\n<対魔戦士>助けて・・・！","\\n<対魔戦士> Help me...!"],["<rekka.angry.right>その汚え手を離しやがれ、クソ魔族！！|#R_0032|","<rekka.angry.right>Let go of that dirty hand, damn demon! ! |#R_0032|"],["\\n<対魔戦士>れ・・・烈火さん！","\\n<対魔戦士> Rekka-san!"],["<rekka.angry.left>白昼堂々目立つことしやがって！\nタダで済むと思うなよ！|#R_0033|","<rekka.angry.left>This is something that stands out in broad daylight!\nDon't think it'll be free! |#R_0033|"],["自動実行イベント終了後","After the automatic execution event ends"],["DAEMON_A","DAEMON_A"],["DAEMON_B","DAEMON_B"],["DAEMON_C","DAEMON_C"],["対魔戦士A","Anti-Demon Warrior A"],["EV007","EV007"],["烈火","Revive"],["EV009","EV009"]],"context":[["Map113/note"],["Map113/events/2/name"],["Map113/events/2/pages/0/list/0/comment"],["Map113/events/2/pages/0/list/9/Plugin Command"],["Map113/events/2/pages/0/list/15/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map113/events/2/pages/0/list/17/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map113/events/2/pages/0/list/28/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map113/events/2/pages/0/list/30/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map113/events/2/pages/0/list/32/Plugin Command"],["Map113/events/2/pages/0/list/33/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map113/events/2/pages/0/list/35/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map113/events/2/pages/0/list/40/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map113/events/2/pages/0/list/51/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map113/events/2/pages/0/list/55/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map113/events/2/pages/0/list/59/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map113/events/2/pages/0/list/61/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map113/events/2/pages/0/list/65/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map113/events/2/pages/0/list/67/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map113/events/2/pages/0/list/69/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map113/events/2/pages/0/list/80/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map113/events/2/pages/0/list/93/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map113/eve