3_base 0 0 255 1 0\nLAYER 6 map03_envTexture -1 -1 255 2 0 2 2":0,"対魔戦士A":1,"管理イベント_03":2,"EVENT ID\n006: 対魔戦士\n003: DAEMON A\n004: DAEMON B\n005: DAEMON C\n007: 倒れた少女":3,"EVENT ID\n008: 烈火\n009: 美月\n010: セシリア":4,"CAM EVENT 003":5,"\\n<魔族>ぐああああああっ！？":6,"\\n<魔族>なんだコイツ・・・！？ とんでもなく強ええ！":7,"<mizuki.idle.left>対魔戦士にもランクがあるのを知らないのかしら？|#M_0049|":8,"CAM EVENT 009":9,"<mizuki.idle.left>烈火ちゃんは最速でA級対魔戦士に昇格した\nすごい子なのよ？|#M_0050|":10,"\\n<魔族>なんだと・・・！？":11,"CAM EVENT 008":12,"<rekka.happy.right>ちなみに美月姉は あたしのさらに上を行く\nS級対魔戦士だ|#R_0034|":13,"<rekka.idle.right>アタシたちに出会った時点で\nお前の負けは決まってたんだよ|#R_0035|":14,"CAM EVENT 007":15,"\\n<魔族>くっ くっそおおお！":16,"<rekka.angry.right>誘拐事件にはずっとイライラしてたんだ|#R_0036|":17,"<rekka.angry.right>まだまだこんなもんじゃ済まさねえっすよ！|#R_0037|":18,"\\n<???>おやめください！ 烈火さん！ |#S_0001|":19,"！！！":20,"CAM EVENT 010":21,"\\n<市民たち>おい あれってアリス教の・・・":22,"<sesiria.idle.right>暴力ではなにも解決しません\nまずは話を聞くべきです|#S_0003|":23,"<rekka.surprise.left>せ セシリア!?|#R_0038|":24,"自動実行終了後":25,"DAEMON_A":26,"DAEMON_B":27,"DAEMON_C":28,"EV007":29,"烈火":30,"美月":31,"セシリア":32,"EV011":33},"extension":"json","dataType":"map","filename":"Map114","basename":"Map114.json","path":"data/Map114.json","relPath":"data/Map114.json","dirname":"/data","originalFormat":"RPG MAKER MV RAW DATA","lineBreak":"\n","type":"","indexIsBuilt":false,"progress":{"translated":34,"length":34,"percent":100}},"data/Map115.json":{"data":[["LAYER_S 1 map03_base 0 0 255 1 0\nLAYER 6 map03_envTexture -1 -1 255 2 0 2 2","LAYER_S 1 map03_base 0 0 255 1 0\nLAYER 6 map03_envTexture -1 -1 255 2 0 2 2"],["対魔戦士A","Anti-Demon Warrior A"],["管理イベント_03","Management Event _03"],["EVENT ID\n006: 対魔戦士\n003: DAEMON A\n004: DAEMON B\n005: DAEMON C\n007: 倒れた少女","EVENT ID\n006: Anti-Demon Warrior\n003: DAEMON A\n004: DAEMON B\n005: DAEMON C\n007: The fallen girl"],["EVENT ID\n008: 烈火\n009: 美月\n010: セシリア","EVENT ID\n008: Retsuka\n009: Mizuki\n010: Cecilia"],["\\n<市民A>なあ あのかわいいシスターって誰なんだ？","\\n<市民A> Who is that cute sister?"],["\\n<市民B>お前知らねえのか？ セシリア様だよ","\\n<市民B> You don't know? It's Cecilia"],["\\n<市民B>万物の調和を重んじる「アリス教」のトップだ","\\n<市民B> This is the top of \"Alice Church,\" which values ​​harmony among all things."],["\\n<市民A>トップ！？　あんな若い子が！？","\\n<市民A> Top! ? Such a young girl! ?"],["CAM EVENT 008","CAM EVENT 008"],["<rekka.angry.left>セシリア！そいつは誘拐事件の犯人っすよ！？|#R_0039|","<rekka.angry.left>Cecilia! He's the culprit of a kidnapping case! ? |#R_0039|"],["CAM EVENT 007","CAM EVENT 007"],["<rekka.angry.left>この子たちをこんな目に合わせた魔族を\n見過ごせって言うんすか！？|#R_0040|","<rekka.angry.left>The demons who match these kids with these eyes\nAre you saying you should overlook it? ? |#R_0040|"],["CAM EVENT 010","CAM EVENT 010"],["<sesiria.angry.right>烈火さん 落ち着いてください|#S_0002|","<sesiria.angry.right>Rekka-san, please calm down|#S_0002|"],["<sesiria.angry.right>暴力では何も解決しません 話を聞くべきです|#S_0003|","<sesiria.angry.right> Violence won't solve anything, you should listen to it|#S_0003|"],["CAM EVENT 003","CAM EVENT 003"],["<rekka.angry.left>コイツが素直に話すなんて思えないっすけどね！|#R_0041|","<rekka.angry.left>I can't believe this guy would speak honestly! |#R_0041|"],["\\n<魔族>くっ・・・","\\n<魔族> damn..."],["<sesiria.angry.right>いいえ 人と魔族は分かりあえます|#S_0004|","<sesiria.angry.right>No People and demons can understand each other|#S_0004|"],["<sesiria.angry.right>そのためにも まずは私たちから歩み寄らなければ|#S_0005|","<sesiria.angry.right>To do this, we must first approach you|#S_0005|"],["<rekka.angry.left>そんなこと言ってると 今度はセシリアが危ない目に合うっすよ|#R_0042|","<rekka.angry.left>If you say that, Cecilia will be in danger this time|#R_0042|"],["<sesiria.happy.right>烈火さん お忘れですか？\n私もあなたと同じ「A級対魔戦士」なんですよ|#S_0006|","<sesiria.happy.right>Rekka-san, have you forgotten?\nI'm the same \"A-class demon warrior\" as you |#S_0006|"],["<sesiria.happy.right>それに 話をするのに対魔戦士の力は必要ありません|#S_0007|","<sesiria.happy.right>And you don't need the power of an anti-magic warrior to talk about it|#S_0007|"],["<sesiria.idle.right>誠実に向き合う そうすればきっとこの方も\n協力してくれるはずです|#S_0008|","<sesiria.idle.right>Face it honestly, then I'm sure this person will also be\nThey should help you |#S_0008|"],["\\n<魔族>・・・","\\n<魔族>..."],["<rekka.angry.left>セシリアは甘すぎっすよ・・・|#R_0043|","<rekka.angry.left>Cecilia is too sweet...|#R_0043|"],["CAM EVENT 009","CAM EVENT 009"],["<mizuki.idle.left>烈火ちゃん ひとまずセシリアに任せましょう|#M_0051|","<mizuki.idle.left>Rekka-chan Let's leave it to Cecilia for now|#M_0051|"],["<mizuki.idle.left>それより 誘拐されそうになってた子は無事？|#M_0052|","<mizuki.idle.left>Above that the child who was about to be kidnapped is safe? |#M_0052|"],["\\n<対魔戦士A>外傷はないですが 意識が混濁しています","\\n<対魔戦士A>There is no trauma, but my consciousness is muddy"],["\\n<対魔戦士A>魔族が何かをしたとしか・・・","\\n<対魔戦士A> Just the demons did something..."],["<rekka.angry.right>きっとコレっすね コイツの持ち物にありました|#R_0044|","<rekka.angry.right>This is sure to be it. It was in this guy's possession|#R_0044|"],["<mizuki.angry.right>何かしらコレ ドロっとしてて少し気持ち悪いわね|#M_0053|","<mizuki.angry.right>Something like this is so messy and a little disgusting|#M_0053|"],["<rekka.angry.left>本人に聞くのが早いっすよ\nおい これは一体何だ？|#R_0045|","<rekka.angry.left>You'll be quick to ask the person himself\nHey, what the hell is this? |#R_0045|"],["\\n<魔族>し 知らねえよ！","\\n<魔族> I don't know!"],["<rekka.angry.left>あまりアタシを怒らせないほうが良いっすよ？|#R_0046|","<rekka.angry.left>It's better not to make me angry too much, right? |#R_0046|"],["<rekka.angry.left>言うこと効かないと\nうっかりお前の頭を吹き飛ばしちゃうかも・・・|#R_0047|","<rekka.angry.left>If what you say doesn't work\nI might accidentally blow your head off...|#R_0047|"],["\\n<魔族>わわわ わかったよ！","\\n<魔族>Wow I understand!"],["\\n<魔族>それは「魔界生物」のエキスだ！","\\n<魔族> It is an extract of \"Demon creatures\"!"],["<rekka.angry.left>魔界生物？|#R_0048|","<rekka.angry.left>Magical creature? |#R_0048|"],["\\n<魔族>そいつには催眠効果があるんだよ！","\\n<魔族>It has a hypnotic effect!"],["\\n<魔族>匂いを嗅いだだけで普通のメスは\n発情し性行為のことしか頭にない性奴隷になる","\\n<魔族> Just smelling it makes a normal female\nHe becomes a sexual slave who is only in his mind when he is horny."],["<rekka.angry.left>そんな危ないもの どこで手に入れたんすか？|#R_0049|","<rekka.angry.left>Where did you get such a dangerous thing? |#R_0049|"],["\\n<魔族>そ それは・・・","\\n<魔族> That's..."],["\\n<魔族>あっ！ こんなときに・・・！？","\\n<魔族>Ah! At times like this...! ?"],["<mizuki.angry.right>これ 魔族の通信端末みたいね|#M_0054|","<mizuki.angry.right>This looks like a demon communication terminal |#M_0054|"],["\\n<魔族>待て！ それにさわるな！","Wait \\n<魔族>! Don't touch that!"],["<rekka.angry.left>コイツの仲間かもしれないっすよ！\n情報を聞き出しましょう！|#R_0050|","<rekka.angry.left>He might be a friend of this guy!\nLet's find out the information! |#R_0050|"],["自動実行終了後","After automatic execution ends"],["DAEMON_A","DAEMON_A"],["DAEMON_B","DAEMON_B"],["DAEMON_C","DAEMON_C"],["EV007","EV007"],["烈火","Revive"],["美月","Mizuki"],["セシリア","Cecilia"]],"context":[["Map115/note"],["Map115/events/1/name"],["Map115/events/2/name"],["Map115/events/2/pages/0/list/0/comment"],["Map115/events/2/pages/0/list/6/comment"],["Map115/events/2/pages/0/list/15/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map115/events/2/pages/0/list/17/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map115/events/2/pages/0/list/19/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map115/events/2/pages/0/list/21/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map115/events/2/pages/0/list/23/Plugin Command","Map115/events/2/pages/0/list/47/Plugin Command","Map115/events/2/pages/0/list/63/Plugin Command","Map115/events/2/pages/0/list/90/Plugin Command"],["Map115/events/2/pages/0/list/25/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map115/events/2/pages/0/list/27/Plugin Command"],["Map115/events/2/pages/0/list/28/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map115/events/2/pages/0/list/31/Plugin Command","Map115/events/2/pages/0/list/42/Plugin Command","Map115/events/2/pages/0/list/50/Plugin Command"],["Map115/events/2/pages/0/list/32/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map115/events/2/pages/0/list/34/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map115/events/2/pages/0/list/36/Plugin Command"],["Map115/events/2/pages/0/list/37/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map115/events/2/pages/0/list/40/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map115/events/2/pages/0/list/43/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map115/events/2/pages/0/list/45/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map115/events/2/pages/0/list/48/message/noPicture/bottom"],[