！":41,"\\n<魔族>匂いを嗅いだだけで普通のメスは\n発情し性行為のことしか頭にない性奴隷になる":42,"<rekka.angry.left>そんな危ないもの どこで手に入れたんすか？|#R_0049|":43,"\\n<魔族>そ それは・・・":44,"\\n<魔族>あっ！ こんなときに・・・！？":45,"<mizuki.angry.right>これ 魔族の通信端末みたいね|#M_0054|":46,"\\n<魔族>待て！ それにさわるな！":47,"<rekka.angry.left>コイツの仲間かもしれないっすよ！\n情報を聞き出しましょう！|#R_0050|":48,"自動実行終了後":49,"DAEMON_A":50,"DAEMON_B":51,"DAEMON_C":52,"EV007":53,"烈火":54,"美月":55,"セシリア":56},"extension":"json","dataType":"map","filename":"Map115","basename":"Map115.json","path":"data/Map115.json","relPath":"data/Map115.json","dirname":"/data","originalFormat":"RPG MAKER MV RAW DATA","lineBreak":"\n","type":"","indexIsBuilt":false,"progress":{"translated":57,"length":57,"percent":100}},"data/Map116.json":{"data":[["LAYER_S 1 map03_base 0 0 255 1 0\nLAYER 6 map03_envTexture -1 -1 255 2 0 2 2","LAYER_S 1 map03_base 0 0 255 1 0\nLAYER 6 map03_envTexture -1 -1 255 2 0 2 2"],["EV001","EV001"],["管理イベント_03","Management Event _03"],["EVENT ID\n006: 対魔戦士\n003: DAEMON A\n004: DAEMON B\n005: DAEMON C\n007: 倒れた少女","EVENT ID\n006: Anti-Demon Warrior\n003: DAEMON A\n004: DAEMON B\n005: DAEMON C\n007: The fallen girl"],["EVENT ID\n008: 烈火\n009: 美月\n010: セシリア","EVENT ID\n008: Retsuka\n009: Mizuki\n010: Cecilia"],["\\n<???>おい そっちの状況はどうだ？","\\n<???>Hey, how's that situation?"],["\\n<???>良い「人材」は見つかったか？","\\n<???>Have you found a good \"human resource\"?"],["<mizuki.angry.left>あなた この魔族のお仲間？|#M_0055|","<mizuki.angry.left>You're a friend of this demon? |#M_0055|"],["\\n<???>・・・","\\n<???>..."],["\\n<???>お前は誰だ？ どうしてこの端末を持ってる？","\\n<???>Who are you? Why do you have this device?"],["<mizuki.angry.left>悪いけど あなたの友達は捕まえたから|#M_0056|","<mizuki.angry.left>Sorry, but I caught your friend|#M_0056|"],["\\n<???>そうか 対魔戦士か","\\n<???>Is that so, a demon warrior?"],["\\n<???>ククク・・・おもしろい","\\n<???> Squeak... Interesting"],["<mizuki.angry.left>あなたも覚悟してなさい|#M_0057|","<mizuki.angry.left>You should be prepared too|#M_0057|"],["<mizuki.angry.left>この魔族から情報を聞き出して\n一網打尽にしてやるわ|#M_0058|","<mizuki.angry.left>Get information from this demon\nI'll just beat you up|#M_0058|"],["\\n<???>その必要はない","\\n<???> No need for that"],["\\n<???>こっちから情報をくれてやる","\\n<???> I'll give you some information from here"],["<mizuki.angry.left>・・・どういうこと？|#M_0059|","<mizuki.angry.left>...What does that mean? |#M_0059|"],["\\n<???>「あかり」って名前の対魔戦士を知ってるか？","\\n<???> Do you know the anti-demon warrior named \"Akari\"?"],["<mizuki.surprise.left>あ あかり・・・！？|#M_0060|","<mizuki.surprise.left>Ah, Akari...! ? |#M_0060|"],["<rekka.surprise.right>どうしてあかりちゃんの名前が？|#R_0051|","<rekka.surprise.right>Why is Akari's name? |#R_0051|"],["\\n<???>ほう？ 知っているのか？","\\n<???>? Do you know?"],["<mizuki.angry.left>知ってるも何も・・・ 私の娘の名前よ|#M_0061|","<mizuki.angry.left>I know nothing... my daughter's name|#M_0061|"],["\\n<???>むすめ・・・娘だと・・・？","\\n<???>My daughter...?"],["\\n<???>アーッハッハッハッハ！","\\n<???>Ahhahaha!"],["<mizuki.angry.left>な 何がおかしいのよ！ 娘は関係ないでしょ！|#M_0062|","<mizuki.angry.left>What's wrong? My daughter has nothing to do with it! |#M_0062|"],["\\n<???>お前の娘は いまどうしてると思う？","\\n<???>What do you think your daughter is doing now?"],["<mizuki.angry.left>娘は対魔戦士よ 今日も任務に出ているはず・・・|#M_0063|","<mizuki.angry.left>My daughter is an anti-magic warrior He should be on mission again today...|#M_0063|"],["\\n<???>あかりちゃんは いま 「魔族娼館」にいる","\\n<???> Akari is currently at the \"Demon Brothel\""],["<mizuki.surprise.left>魔族娼館！？ あ あんな危険な場所に行くはずが・・・|#M_0064|","<mizuki.surprise.left>Demon Brothel! ? Ah I was supposed to go to such a dangerous place...|#M_0064|"],["<mizuki.surprise.left>ま まさか・・・|#M_0065|","<mizuki.surprise.left>No way...|#M_0065|"],["\\n<???>ククク・・・","\\n<???>Shut up..."],["\\n<???>お母さんが呼んでいるぞ？ あかりちゃん？","\\n<???> Mom is calling you? Akari-chan?"],["<emuji.emuji2.event>ま・・・ママ・・・|#A_0042|","<emuji.emuji2.event>Ma...Mom...|#A_0042|"],["\\n<美月>う・・・うそっ あかり・・・！？ |#M_0066|","\\n<Mizuki>... No way, Akari...! ? |#M_0066|"],["<emuji.emuji2.event>まま・・・たす・・・けて・・・|#A_0043|","<emuji.emuji2.event>Remain...Remain...|#A_0043|"],["\\n<美月>あかり！あかり！うそ どうしてそんな・・・ |#M_0067|","\\n<Mizuki> Akari! Akari! No way why... |#M_0067|"],["\\n<美月>いまどこにいるの！すぐに助けに行くわ！|#M_0068|","\\n<Mizuki>Where are you now? I'll go and help you soon! |#M_0068|"],["\\n<烈火>な なんだよこれ！？|#R_0052|","What is this?! ? |#R_0052|"],["\\n<セシリア>ひ ひどすぎます・・・|#S_0009|","\\n<Cecilia>h It's so bad...|#S_0009|"],["\\n<美月>あかり答えて！ いまどこにいるの！？|#M_0069|","\\n<Mizuki> Akari answer! Where are you now? ? |#M_0069|"],["魔族娼館・・・その地下・・・|#A_0044|","Demon Brothel... its underground...|#A_0044|"],["\\n<美月>そんな・・・魔族の本拠地に一人で潜入するなんて・・・|#M_0070|","\\n<Mizuki> That's not what... I was going to sneak into the home of a demon on my own...|#M_0070|"],["誘拐されたひと・・・ここにいると思って・・・|#A_0045|","The kidnapped person... I thought I was here...|#A_0045|"],["でも見つけたよママ・・・\nみんな ここにいる・・・|#A_0046|","But I found it mom...\nEveryone is here...|#A_0046|"],["\\n<烈火>やっぱり・・・結局ぜんぶ魔族の仕業かよ・・・！|#R_0053|","\\n<Rekka> After all... after all, it's all done by the demons...! |#R_0053|"],["\\n<???>ククク・・・ そのとおり","\\n<???> Squeak... That's right"],["\\n<美月>娘になんてことを・・・絶対に許さない・・・！|#M_0071|","\\n<Mizuki> I will never forgive my daughter...! |#M_0071|"],["\\n<???>こうなることを望んだのは お前の娘だ","\\n<???>It was your daughter who wanted this to happen."],["\\n<???>対魔戦士を裏切るつもりがないというから\n「奴隷娼婦」にすることにしたんだ","\\n<???> He says he has no intention of betraying the anti-demon warrior.\nI decided to make it a \"slave whore.\""],["\\n<セシリア>奴隷娼婦・・・？|#S_0010|","\\n<Cecilia>Slave prostitute...? |#S_0010|"],["\\n<???>なんでも言うことを聞く性奴隷に調教中ってことだよ","\\n<???>It means you're being trained to be a sex slave who listens to anything"],["\\n<烈火>てめえ・・・顔を見せろ\nいますぐブチ殺しにいってやる・・・！|#R_0054|","\\n<Rekka>, yeah... Show me your face\nI'll go kill you right away...! |#R_0054|"],["\\n<???>お前は少しも変わらないな 烈火！","\\n<???> You haven't changed a little Rekka!"],["\\n<烈火>な なんで私の名前を・・・！？|#R_0055|","\\n<Rekka> Why my name...! ? |#R_0055|"],["\\n<???>お前も私の名前を知っているはずだぞ","\\n<???> You must know my name too"],["\\n<???>対魔戦士になったばかりの頃の\n「醜態」を思い出すんだ ククク・・・","\\n<???>When I was just becoming an anti-magic warrior\nIt reminds me of \"absoluteness\""],["\\n<烈火>っ・・・！お前まさか！？|#R_0057|","\\n<Rekka>...! You can't believe it! ? |#R_0057|"],["\\n<美月>烈火ちゃん 知っているの？|#M_0072|","\\n<Mizuki>Rekka-chan Do you know? |#M_0072|"],["\\n<???>ククク・・・もちろん知っているさ\n私も烈火をよく知っている","\\n<???> Squeak... Of course I know\nI know Rekka well too"],["\\n<烈火>くそが・・・！|#R_0058|","\\n<Rekka> Damn it...! |#R_0058|"],["\\n<烈火>てめえ そこ動くんじゃねえぞ！|#R_0059|","\\n<Rekka>, don't move there! |#R_0059|"],["\\n<セシリア>烈火さん！？|#S_0011|","\\n<Cecilia> Rekka-san! ? |#S_0011|"],["\\n<???>ククク・・・あのときと少しも変わってない","\\n<???> squeak...it's not changed a bit since then"],["\\n<???>お前たちも この娘を助けたければ娼館に来い","\\n<???> If you want to help this girl, come to the brothel too."],["\\n<???>調教が完了したら 母親のことも思い出せないかもな","\\n<???> Once the training is complete, I might not remember my mother either."],["<emuji.emuji2.event>ま ママ・・・|#A_0047|","<emuji.emuji2.event>Ma Mama...|#A_0047|"],["わたしは・・・ 奴隷になんてならない・・・|#A_0048|","I'm not going to be a slave...|#A_0048|"],["みんなが来るまで 待ってるから・・・！|#A_0049|","I'll wait until everyone comes...! |#A_0049|"],["んぎぃぃぃぃぃぃ♡|#A_0050|","Ngyaii♡|#A_0050|"],["あぁ・・・ ママぁ・・・|#A_0051|","Ah... Mama...|#A_0051|"],["あたし・・・まけないからぁ・・|#A_0052|","I...it's not a bonus...|#A_0052|"],["\\n<???>さすが対魔戦士 意外とタフだな","\\n<???>As expected of the anti-demon warrior, he's surprisingly tough"],["\\n<???>では 魔族娼館で待っているぞ","At \\n<???>, I'm waiting at the demon brothel"],["\\n<???>さらばだ","\\n<???>Farewell"],["自動実行終了後","After automatic execution ends"],["DAEMON_A","DAEMON_A"],["DAEMON_B","DAEMON_B"],["DAEMON_C","DAEMON_C"],["EV007","EV007"],["烈火","Revive"],["美月","Mizuki"],["セシリア","Cecilia"]],"context":[["Map116/note"],["Map116/events/1/name"],["Map116/events/2/name"],["Map116/events/2/pages/0/list/0/comment"],["Map116/events/2/pages/0/list/6/comment"],["Map116/events/2/pages/0/list/22/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map116/events/2/pages/0/list/24/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map116/events/2/pages/0/list/27/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map116/events/2/pages/0/list/29/message/n