"",0,0,2]}],[{"headerIndex":179,"headerParam":["",0,0,2]}],[{"headerIndex":181,"headerParam":["",0,0,2]}],[{"headerIndex":0,"headerParam":["自動実行終了後"]}],[],[],[],[],[],[],[]],"indexIds":{"LAYER_S 1 map03_base 0 0 255 1 0\nLAYER 6 map03_envTexture -1 -1 255 2 0 2 2":0,"EV001":1,"管理イベント_03":2,"EVENT ID\n006: 対魔戦士\n003: DAEMON A\n004: DAEMON B\n005: DAEMON C\n007: 倒れた少女":3,"EVENT ID\n008: 烈火\n009: 美月\n010: セシリア":4,"\\n<???>おい そっちの状況はどうだ？":5,"\\n<???>良い「人材」は見つかったか？":6,"<mizuki.angry.left>あなた この魔族のお仲間？|#M_0055|":7,"\\n<???>・・・":8,"\\n<???>お前は誰だ？ どうしてこの端末を持ってる？":9,"<mizuki.angry.left>悪いけど あなたの友達は捕まえたから|#M_0056|":10,"\\n<???>そうか 対魔戦士か":11,"\\n<???>ククク・・・おもしろい":12,"<mizuki.angry.left>あなたも覚悟してなさい|#M_0057|":13,"<mizuki.angry.left>この魔族から情報を聞き出して\n一網打尽にしてやるわ|#M_0058|":14,"\\n<???>その必要はない":15,"\\n<???>こっちから情報をくれてやる":16,"<mizuki.angry.left>・・・どういうこと？|#M_0059|":17,"\\n<???>「あかり」って名前の対魔戦士を知ってるか？":18,"<mizuki.surprise.left>あ あかり・・・！？|#M_0060|":19,"<rekka.surprise.right>どうしてあかりちゃんの名前が？|#R_0051|":20,"\\n<???>ほう？ 知っているのか？":21,"<mizuki.angry.left>知ってるも何も・・・ 私の娘の名前よ|#M_0061|":22,"\\n<???>むすめ・・・娘だと・・・？":23,"\\n<???>アーッハッハッハッハ！":24,"<mizuki.angry.left>な 何がおかしいのよ！ 娘は関係ないでしょ！|#M_0062|":25,"\\n<???>お前の娘は いまどうしてると思う？":26,"<mizuki.angry.left>娘は対魔戦士よ 今日も任務に出ているはず・・・|#M_0063|":27,"\\n<???>あかりちゃんは いま 「魔族娼館」にいる":28,"<mizuki.surprise.left>魔族娼館！？ あ あんな危険な場所に行くはずが・・・|#M_0064|":29,"<mizuki.surprise.left>ま まさか・・・|#M_0065|":30,"\\n<???>ククク・・・":31,"\\n<???>お母さんが呼んでいるぞ？ あかりちゃん？":32,"<emuji.emuji2.event>ま・・・ママ・・・|#A_0042|":33,"\\n<美月>う・・・うそっ あかり・・・！？ |#M_0066|":34,"<emuji.emuji2.event>まま・・・たす・・・けて・・・|#A_0043|":35,"\\n<美月>あかり！あかり！うそ どうしてそんな・・・ |#M_0067|":36,"\\n<美月>いまどこにいるの！すぐに助けに行くわ！|#M_0068|":37,"\\n<烈火>な なんだよこれ！？|#R_0052|":38,"\\n<セシリア>ひ ひどすぎます・・・|#S_0009|":39,"\\n<美月>あかり答えて！ いまどこにいるの！？|#M_0069|":40,"魔族娼館・・・その地下・・・|#A_0044|":41,"\\n<美月>そんな・・・魔族の本拠地に一人で潜入するなんて・・・|#M_0070|":42,"誘拐されたひと・・・ここにいると思って・・・|#A_0045|":43,"でも見つけたよママ・・・\nみんな ここにいる・・・|#A_0046|":44,"\\n<烈火>やっぱり・・・結局ぜんぶ魔族の仕業かよ・・・！|#R_0053|":45,"\\n<???>ククク・・・ そのとおり":46,"\\n<美月>娘になんてことを・・・絶対に許さない・・・！|#M_0071|":47,"\\n<???>こうなることを望んだのは お前の娘だ":48,"\\n<???>対魔戦士を裏切るつもりがないというから\n「奴隷娼婦」にすることにしたんだ":49,"\\n<セシリア>奴隷娼婦・・・？|#S_0010|":50,"\\n<???>なんでも言うことを聞く性奴隷に調教中ってことだよ":51,"\\n<烈火>てめえ・・・顔を見せろ\nいますぐブチ殺しにいってやる・・・！|#R_0054|":52,"\\n<???>お前は少しも変わらないな 烈火！":53,"\\n<烈火>な なんで私の名前を・・・！？|#R_0055|":54,"\\n<???>お前も私の名前を知っているはずだぞ":55,"\\n<???>対魔戦士になったばかりの頃の\n「醜態」を思い出すんだ ククク・・・":56,"\\n<烈火>っ・・・！お前まさか！？|#R_0057|":57,"\\n<美月>烈火ちゃん 知っているの？|#M_0072|":58,"\\n<???>ククク・・・もちろん知っているさ\n私も烈火をよく知っている":59,"\\n<烈火>くそが・・・！|#R_0058|":60,"\\n<烈火>てめえ そこ動くんじゃねえぞ！|#R_0059|":61,"\\n<セシリア>烈火さん！？|#S_0011|":62,"\\n<???>ククク・・・あのときと少しも変わってない":63,"\\n<???>お前たちも この娘を助けたければ娼館に来い":64,"\\n<???>調教が完了したら 母親のことも思い出せないかもな":65,"<emuji.emuji2.event>ま ママ・・・|#A_0047|":66,"わたしは・・・ 奴隷になんてならない・・・|#A_0048|":67,"みんなが来るまで 待ってるから・・・！|#A_0049|":68,"んぎぃぃぃぃぃぃ♡|#A_0050|":69,"あぁ・・・ ママぁ・・・|#A_0051|":70,"あたし・・・まけないからぁ・・|#A_0052|":71,"\\n<???>さすが対魔戦士 意外とタフだな":72,"\\n<???>では 魔族娼館で待っているぞ":73,"\\n<???>さらばだ":74,"自動実行終了後":75,"DAEMON_A":76,"DAEMON_B":77,"DAEMON_C":78,"EV007":79,"烈火":80,"美月":81,"セシリア":82},"extension":"json","dataType":"map","filename":"Map116","basename":"Map116.json","path":"data/Map116.json","relPath":"data/Map116.json","dirname":"/data","originalFormat":"RPG MAKER MV RAW DATA","lineBreak":"\n","type":"","indexIsBuilt":false,"progress":{"translated":83,"length":83,"percent":100}},"data/Map117.json":{"data":[["LAYER_S 1 map03_base 0 0 255 1 0\nLAYER 6 map03_envTexture -1 -1 255 2 0 2 2","LAYER_S 1 map03_base 0 0 255 1 0\nLAYER 6 map03_envTexture -1 -1 255 2 0 2 2"],["EV001","EV001"],["管理イベント_03","Management Event _03"],["EVENT ID\n006: 対魔戦士\n003: DAEMON A\n004: DAEMON B\n005: DAEMON C\n007: 倒れた少女","EVENT ID\n006: Anti-Demon Warrior\n003: DAEMON A\n004: DAEMON B\n005: DAEMON C\n007: The fallen girl"],["EVENT ID\n008: 烈火\n009: 美月\n010: セシリア","EVENT ID\n008: Retsuka\n009: Mizuki\n010: Cecilia"],["CAM EVENT 009","CAM EVENT 009"],["<mizuki.sad.left>あかり・・・ まさかあの場所に潜入するなんて・・・|#M_0074|","<mizuki.sad.left>Akari... I can't believe he's infiltrating that place...|#M_0074|"],["<mizuki.sad.left>あれだけ危ないって伝えたのに・・・|#M_0075|","<mizuki.sad.left>I told you it was so dangerous...|#M_0075|"],["<sesiria.angry.right>美月さん 助けに行くんですね\n奴隷情館に|#S_0012|","<sesiria.angry.right>Mizuki-san, you're going to help me\nTo the Slave Hall |#S_0012|"],["<mizuki.sad.left>あかりだけじゃない\n誘拐された人や 対魔戦士たちもいる・・・|#M_0076|","<mizuki.sad.left>It's not just light\nThere are also people who have been kidnapped and some anti-demon warriors...|#M_0076|"],["<mizuki.angry.left>セシリア 今回はあなたの言うことを聞けそうにないわ|#M_0077|","<mizuki.angry.left>Cecilia I don't think I'll listen to you this time|#M_0077|"],["<mizuki.angry.left>魔族を倒して みんなを救い出す・・・！|#M_0078|","<mizuki.angry.left>Defeat the demons and save everyone...! |#M_0078|"],["<sesiria.angry.right>美月さん・・・|#S_0013|","<sesiria.angry.right>Mizuki-san...|#S_0013|"],["<sesiria.angry.right>私もついていきます|#S_0014|","<sesiria.angry.right>I'll follow you too|#S_0014|"],["<mizuki.angry.left>セシリア・・・|#M_0079|","<mizuki.angry.left>Cecilia...|#M_0079|"],["<mizuki.angry.left>気持ちは嬉しいけど あなたはついてくるべきじゃないわ|#M_0080|","<mizuki.angry.left>I'm happy about it, but you shouldn't follow|#M_0080|"],["<mizuki.sad.left>さっきの映像を見たでしょう あかりのあの姿・・・|#M_0081|","<mizuki.sad.left>You've seen the video just now. Akari's appearance...|#M_0081|"],["<mizuki.angry.left>アリス教のあなたには とても耐え難い場所よ|#M_0082|","<mizuki.angry.left>It's a very unbearable place for you, Alice-Kai-Kai|#M_0082|"],["<sesiria.angry.right>ええ 娼館は純潔とは無縁の場所・・・|#S_0015|","<sesiria.angry.right>Yes, brothels are a place that is not related to purity...|#S_0015|"],["<sesiria.angry.right>アリス教の教えとは真逆の世界です|#S_0016|","<sesiria.angry.right>This is the exact opposite of the teachings of Alice |#S_0016|"],["<sesiria.sad.right>でも あかりちゃんは私の大切な友達です|#S_0018|","<sesiria.sad.right>But Akari-chan is my precious friend|#S_0018|"],["<sesiria.angry.right>この事件を遠くから見ているわけにはいかないのです|#S_0019|","<sesiria.angry.right>We can't see this incident from afar|#S_0019|"],["<sesiria.angry.right>アリス教の修道女長として\nそしてもちろん 対魔戦士として・・・|#S_0020|","<sesiria.angry.right>As the chief nun of Alice\nAnd of course, as an anti-demon warrior...|#S_0020|"],["<mizuki.happy.left>ありがとうセシリア あなたは本当に優しいわね|#M_0083|","<mizuki.happy.left>Thank you Cecilia You're really kind|#M_0083|"],["<sesiria.angry.right>美月さん 魔族娼館は彼らの本拠地ともいえる場所です|#S_0021|","<sesiria.angry.right>Mizuki-san The Demon Brothel is a place that can be said to be their home |#S_0021|"],["<sesiria.angry.right>正面から勝負を挑むのは得策ではありません|#S_0022|","<sesiria.angry.right>It's not a good idea to challenge the battle head on|#S_0022|"],["<mizuki.angry.left>それはそうだけど・・・潜入をするの？\nでも一体どうやって・・・？|#M_0084|","<mizuki.angry.left>That's true, but... are you going to infiltrate?\nBut how on earth...? |#M_0084|"],["<sesiria.idle.right>もちろん この方に協力してもらうのです|#S_0023|","<sesiria.idle.right>Of course, I'll ask this person to help you|#S_0023|"],["CAM EVENT 003","CAM EVENT 003"],["\\n<魔族>お 俺かよ・・！？","\\n<魔族> It's me...! ?"],["<mizuki.angry.left>セシリア それは無理だわ\nこの魔族が協力するとは思えない|#M_0085|","<mizuki.angry.left>Cecilia That's not possible\nI don't think this demon would cooperate|#M_0085|"],["<sesiria.idle.right>魔族さん 取引です\n私たちはあなたを捕まえない|#S_0024|","<sesiria.idle.right> Demon's trade\nWe won't catch you|#S_0024|"],["<sesiria.idle.right>そのかわり 私たちを魔族娼館に入れてください|#S_0025|","<sesiria.idle.right>Instead of that, put us in the demon brothel|#S_0025|"],["\\n<魔族>お前 本気で言ってるのか・・・？","\\n<魔族>Are you really saying it...?"],["<mizuki.surprise.left>セシリア！ そんな勝手な取引・・・！|#M_0086|","<mizuki.surprise.left>Cecilia! That kind of selfish transaction...! |#M_0086|"],["<sesiria.angry.right>いずれにせよ 娼館のことを私たちは何も知りません|#S_0026|","<sesiria.angry.right>In any case, we don't know anything about the brothel|#S_0026|"],["<sesiria.angry.right>内部を知る協力者がいたほうが良い・・・|#S_0027|","<sesiria.angry.right>It would be better if there were collaborators who know the inside...|#S_0027|"],["\\n<魔族>へへっ 俺に任せとけ！ 精一杯サポートしてやるよ","\\n<魔族>Hehe, leave it to me! I'll support you as much as I can"],["<mizuki.angry.left>もし裏切ったらどうなるか 分かってるわよね？|#M_0087|","<mizuki.angry.left>You know what happens if you betray them, right? |#M_0087|"],["\\n<魔族>あ ああ！もちろんだ！約束は守るぜ！","\\n<魔族>Ah! Of course! I'll keep my promise!"],["<sesiria.idle.right>教えて下さい どうすれば魔族娼館に入れますか？|#S_0028|","<sesiria.idle.right>Please tell me. How can I enter a demon brothel? |#S_0028|"],["\\n<魔族>とっ とりあえず夜を待つんだ！","\\n<魔族> I'll wait for the night!"],["\\n<魔族>夜にならないと「本当の魔族娼館」には入れない","\\n<魔族>Until the night, you won't be able to enter the \"real demon brothel\""],["<mizuki.angry.left>本当の魔族娼館？|#M_0088|","<mizuki.angry.left>A real demon brothel? |#M_0088|"],["\\n<魔族>昼間は普通の「魔族領事館」なんだよ\n調教施設の扉もすべて閉じられてる","\\n<魔族>It's a normal \"Demon Consulate\" during the day\nAll doors to the training facility are also closed"],["\\n<魔族>夜になると娼婦を求めて 外から客がやってくる\nそのタイミングで中に入るんだ","\\n<魔族>At night, customers come from outside in search of prostitutes\nI'll go inside at that time"],["<mizuki.angry.left>魔族娼館に客がやってくるの？|#M_0089|","<mizuki.angry.left> Are customers coming to the demon brothel? |#M_0089|"],["\\n<魔族>そっ そいつは自分の目で確かめてくれ！","\\n<魔族> So, see it for yourself!"],["\\n<魔族>それと！ 対魔戦士が娼館に入るためには\n「特別な準備」が必要だ","\\n<魔族> And! How to enter the brothel\nSpecial preparations are required"],["\\n<魔族>その準備をするから とりあえず夜まで待ってくれ！\n娼館前で集合だ","\\n<魔族>I'll prepare for that, so just wait until the night!\nWe're meeting in front of the brothel"],["<mizuki.angry.left>まさか逃げる気じゃないでしょうね？|#M_0090|","<mizuki.angry.left>I guess they're not trying to escape, right? |#M_0090|"],["<sesiria.idle.right>美月さん！この方を信じましょう|#S_0029|","<sesiria.idle.right>Mizuki-san! Let's believe this person|#S_0029|"],["\\n<魔族>そのシスターの言うとおりだ！信用してくれ！\nお前たちを娼館のなかに案内してやるから！","\\n<魔族> That sister says! Trust me!\nI'll guide you into the brothel!"],["<mizuki.angry.left>仕方ないわね・・・|#M_0091|","<mizuki.angry.left>There's nothing I can do...|#M_0091|"],["\\n<魔族>じゃあ この時刻に娼館前に来てくれ！\n俺はそれまでに準備を整えておくから！","\\n<魔族>, come in front of the brothel at this time!\nI'll be ready by then!"],["\\n<魔族>お前らこそ 逃げるんじゃねえぞ！","\\n<魔族> You guys aren't going to run away!"],["CAM EVENT 010","CAM EVENT 010"],["<sesiria.idle.right>美月さん 潜入までの時間どうしますか？|#S_0031|","<sesiria.idle.right>Mizuki-san: What time will you take to infiltrate? |#S_0031|"],["<mizuki.sad.left>そうね・・・ 一度家に帰らせて|#M_0092|","<mizuki.sad.left>Yes... Let me go home once|#M_0092|"],["<mizuki.sad.left>夫と少し話がしたい・・・\nあかりのことは言えないけど・・・|#M_0093|","<mizuki.sad.left>I want to talk to my husband a little...\nI can't say anything about Akari but...|#M_0093|"],["<mizuki.angry.left>セシリアも一度帰って準備をしなさい|#M_0094|","<mizuki.angry.left>Cecilia should go home and get ready |#M_0094|"],["<mizuki.angry.left>きっと 長い戦いになるだろうから・・・|#M_0095|","<mizuki.angry.left>It's sure to be a long battle...|#M_0095|"],["<sesiria.angry.right>そうですね わかりました\nでは のちほど|#S_0032|","<sesiria.angry.right>That's right, I understand\nSo, later |#S_0032|"],["\\n<美月>・・・","\\n<Mizuki>..."],["\\n<美月>(先行した烈火ちゃんのことは心配だけど・・・)","\\n<Mizuki> (I'm worried about Rekka-chan who came before him...)"],["\\n<美月>(「対魔戦士は娼館に入れない」から\n足並みは揃うはず・・・)","\\n<Mizuki> (\"Anti-Demon Warriors Can't Enter Brothels\"\nWe should be in line...)"],["\\n<美月>(彼女は強いから きっと大丈夫・・・)","\\n<Mizuki> (She's strong so I'm sure it's okay...)"],["\\n<美月>(だけどあかりは・・・)","\\n<Mizuki> (But Akari is...)"],["\\n<美月>(・・・だめっ 冷静にならなきゃ・・・)","\\n<Mizuki>(...No, I have to be calm...)"],["\\n<美月>(夜になったら娼館に潜入して\nあかりと 誘拐されたみんなを助け出す・・・)","\\n<Mizuki> (Infiltrate the brothel when it's night\nAkari and rescue everyone who was kidnapped...)"],["\\n<美月>(待っててね・・・あかり・・・！)","\\n<Mizuki> (Wait... Akari...!)"],["自動実行終了後","After automatic execution ends"],["DAEMON_A","DAEMON_A"],["DAEMON_B","DAEMON_B"],["DAEMON_C","DAEMON_C"],["EV007","EV007"],["美月","Mizuki"],["セシリア","Cecilia"]],"context":[["Map117/note"],["Map117/events/1/name"],["Map117/events/2/name"],["Map117/events/2/pages/0/list/0/comment"],["Map117/events/2/pages/0/list/6/comment"],["Map117/events/2/pages/0/list/15/Plugin Command"],["Map117/events/2/pages/0/list/17/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map117/events/2/page