he map you want to transition to when the player dies.\nIf you want to revive this event, do not specify anything.\n\nLocation redirection is read from TAIMA_Battle_Respawn.js.\nAvoid changing area using the normal decision button\nIt has been harmless with \"conditional expressions that would never be satisfied.\""],["EV006","EV006"],["コモンイベントテスト","Common Event Test"]],"context":[["Map124/note"],["Map124/events/1/name"],["Map124/events/1/pages/0/list/0/comment"],["Map124/events/1/pages/0/list/2/comment","Map124/events/2/pages/0/list/2/comment"],["Map124/events/1/pages/0/list/3/message/noPicture/middle"],["Map124/events/1/pages/0/list/5/message/noPicture/middle"],["Map124/events/1/pages/0/list/7/message/noPicture/middle"],["Map124/events/1/pages/0/list/9/message/noPicture/middle"],["Map124/events/1/pages/0/list/11/message/noPicture/middle"],["Map124/events/1/pages/0/list/13/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map124/events/2/name"],["Map124/events/2/pages/0/list/0/comment","Map124/events/3/pages/0/list/0/comment"],["Map124/events/2/pages/0/list/3/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map124/events/2/pages/0/list/5/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map124/events/2/pages/0/list/7/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map124/events/2/pages/0/list/9/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map124/events/2/pages/0/list/11/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map124/events/2/pages/0/list/13/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map124/events/2/pages/0/list/15/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map124/events/2/pages/0/list/17/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map124/events/2/pages/0/list/19/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map124/events/2/pages/0/list/21/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map124/events/2/pages/0/list/23/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map124/events/2/pages/0/list/26/comment"],["Map124/events/2/pages/0/list/28/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map124/events/2/pages/0/list/30/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map124/events/2/pages/0/list/32/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map124/events/2/pages/0/list/34/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map124/events/2/page