\nNo additional configuration is required.\nYou can also move the map on death by adding \"location\" to the conditional expression below."],["プレイヤー死亡時に遷移させたいマップを指定してください。\nこのイベント上に復活させたい場合は何も指定しないでください。\n\n場所移動はTAIMA_Battle_Respawn.jsから読み出されます。\n通常の決定ボタンでエリア遷移しないように\n「絶対に満たさないであろう条件式」で無害化しています。","Please specify the map you want to transition to when the player dies.\nIf you want to revive this event, do not specify anything.\n\nLocation redirection is read from TAIMA_Battle_Respawn.js.\nAvoid changing area using the normal decision button\nIt has been harmless with \"conditional expressions that would never be satisfied.\""],["EV006","EV006"],["追憶のかけらを手に入れました","I got a piece of remembrance"],["EV007","EV007"]],"context":[["Map148/displayName"],["Map148/events/1/name"],["Map148/events/1/pages/0/list/1/message/noPicture/middle"],["Map148/events/1/pages/0/list/3/Show Choices/3/1from2"],["Map148/events/1/pages/0/list/3/Show Choices/3/2from2"],["Map148/events/1/pages/0/list/17/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map148/events/1/pages/0/list/20/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map148/events/2/name"],["Map148/events/3/name"],["Map148/events/4/name"],["Map148/events/4/pages/2/list/1/message/noPicture/middle"],["Map148/events/4/pages/3/list/0/message/noPicture/middle"],["Map148/events/4/pages/3/list/3/message/noPicture/middle"],["Map148/events/5/name"],["Map148/events/5/pages/0/list/0/comment"],["Map148/events/5/pages/0/list/4/comment"],["Map148/events/6/name"],["Map148/events/6/pages/0/list/1/message/noPicture/bottom","Map148/events/7/pages/0/list/1/message/noPicture/bottom"],["Map148/events/7/name"]],"tags":[[],["gold"],[],[],[],[],[],["gold"],["gold"],["gold"],[],[],[],["gold"],["blue"],["blue"],["gold"],[],["gold"]],"parameters":[[],[],[{"headerIndex":1,"headerParam":["",0,1,1]}],[],[],[{"headerIndex":17,"headerParam":["",0,0,2]}],[{"headerIndex":20,"headerParam":["",0,0,2]}],[],[],[],[{"headerIndex":1,"headerParam":["",0,1,1]}],[{"headerIndex":0,"headerParam":["",0,1,1]}],[{"head